flowchart LR
  A[Photo] --> B[Compress + EXIF strip + sha256 + coarse location]
  B -->|offline| Q[(Outbox)]
  Q -->|online| C
  B --> C[POST /v1/scans]
  C --> D[Signed PUT to private Storage]
  D --> E[POST analyze]
  E --> F[Validate + re-encode image]
  F --> G[ONNX inference]
  G --> H{calibrated<br/>confidence ≥ τ ?}
  H -- no --> I[Not sure:<br/>retake tips +<br/>local office card]
  H -- yes --> J[Retrieve KB chunks]
  J --> K{score ≥ min?}
  K -- no --> L[Static fallback card]
  K -- yes --> M[LLM advice from chunks]
  M --> N{cited + safe?<br/>V1–V6}
  N -- no --> L
  N -- yes --> O[Persist diagnosis + advice + audit]
  O --> P[Outbreak rules]
  P --> R[Publish labelled alert<br/>unverified, rule-based]
  R --> S[In-app alerts + team notice]
